      "title": "bittorrent: Do some PDU length validity checking",
      "message": "bittorrent: Do some PDU length validity checking\n\nWe know the lengths (or at least bounds on them) for most message\ntypes, so if we have a nonsense value assume that we're actually\nseeing Continuation Data (or unsupported Message Stream Encryption.)\n\nAlso support the extended message type a little bit, at least to\ndisplay the bencoded dictionary when it's type ID 0.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-10-15T19:10:15.000-04:00",
      "committer_name": "Wireshark GitLab Utility",
      "committer_email": "gerald+gitlab-utility@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2021-10-22T04:40:35.000+00:00",
